# Atlant cargo exoskeleton - the joints in the rest pose (Orbiter frame: x right, y up, z forward; origin on the
# ground under the hips). Written by Tantra_Design/blender/mock_atlant.py (ATL_SHOT=mesh). Legs, arms (flex),
# feet, heels, toes, the boom: about the x axis; the slew: about y; the slide and the tele stages: along their dirs.
